│    directory tree and add them again.                              │
│                                                                    │
│ This approach leverages LanceDBMemory's add, get_by_metadata, and  │
│ delete functions to perform CRUD properly. Progress bar and        │
│ console messages keep users informed. If file_key is just the file │
│ basename for removal and update, this is consistent with the       │
│ requirement that removal should remove all chunks with the same    │
│ file name.                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ This patch only modifies mle/cli.py minimally by adding a new      │
│ command group and commands, preserving existing functionality.     │
│ Necessary imports are already present, so no import changes        │
│ required.                                                          │
